    },
    {
      "id": "eea6a2706acde2ebcedc9e6e3906ec178652125cc3edf3b5522bae164a9aa338",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "99dadf39d2a09dc273c0ab949c261dbec295f20676e4a769869dbf3b799c0d6f",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "14b3081b320f6160b3b200ce0e87368705994e8f6d48d2c26e928de8d774f7c2",
      "text": "The Model",
      "hash": "1954409637324f1c3f2cab102211fd161a6cd1c270252fc2e1297a69ab9a446b"
    },
    {
      "id": "24145e24cae3f85caefb0e38a6073b242f422af1776db6c24618430e1581468a",
      "text": "Parameters",
      "hash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bffd731318df8bacf6a24c0fbda7b976d690cc744e924ce5ba04fa3a29c99b71",
      "text": "The numbers inside a model — often billions — tuned during training. Everything the model knows lives in them. Also called weights.",
      "hash": "2e07981549d106263c7492b81e6a49e974245cac92d0bd2493a48fbea79c6aed"
    },
    {
      "id": "d286bd497db27adcbe14ca60f6c5743f89ffe8b8e96afc06581376c36eb81639",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "857c92e9f647d92043e4cb97c1b3ab1fd3b7aefaa6ddeee68b44e90b7c19afc3",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "9b9e9e469d92f29cdaf044b475df935b45190d1d347bf41bc2fb60a833630c95",
      "text": "The numbers inside a",
      "hash": "aecdf032bfbed26e7418aeaeb4e5048fa1827d8a0896bd29235260d5ffc298df"
    },
    {
      "id": "28b1094026455c6934feff148390d21292bc3a4951a990e0b3b8c207c45337c7",
      "text": "— often billions of them — tuned during",
      "hash": "fa876c6e65dd503d28c58f0ec28b9d66ee0abc332fbe576dc76d38b9980f9235"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9cb6a4ca35dafde2d29d69fcfd72164848be91fb7428a4e771113fc88855899",
      "text": ". Everything the model \"knows\" lives in them. Training sets them;",
      "hash": "6d374f637c9ccc90628fd42f3b9239ac4c14a94a687aa36bc044b5cf209b3680"
    },
    {
      "id": "3bf1913cd9048fe5650e3e49390ad792bd689a9f0d46d190de247f90cf798387",
      "text": "uses them unchanged. Also called",
      "hash": "60c3da749af1a896bd07635fcc991d17974937b71cbe2b22f6a2259a12c832b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "4008deb063c36e9fbc2d8260f5a56e1a806c19b64a0b543323b1a1df1135356a",
      "text": "Mechanically, the parameters are what turn input into output.",
      "hash": "2d7c535826ad266161cbb2df72e8c1d29f7e641117a2a99d195f21d85b05c596"
    },
    {
      "id": "ca807de48b4160749960faed7fa6151bf511c829a12d293c19f11fd1cd664d58",
      "text": "Next-token prediction",
      "hash": "db2e13aa671f566f6c582c8ff074e0b702a81659695c239d0634c86b0e328583"
    },
    {
      "id": "55058c831642570afd5a97e974517c3b53b33a9bb09a829cec78efc33d646ae1",
      "text": "is a giant calculation: the",
      "hash": "d128cbf43de900a8d33bd36e3fde7076a40b254aa544343d80418354190747e9"
    },
    {
      "id": "56095c5059cd609589b828bcb5a336d66efb48e64d4cc761d66baebc6935b70b",
      "text": "in the",
      "hash": "866ab23f02991a070ef7b06fc39ab77a0e9e840db9d0dabb204735b109d4a52c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bdf21d5f03171241755ac5b33354a392de735a1b9fb3eb42277dcaa6c723e911",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "2e819a4d7e9dd7813f15e545f4f71ea5b5e7550089695632fc756596e7abfffd",
      "text": "go in, get multiplied through the parameters, and a prediction for the next token comes out. There is no database of facts inside the model, no code lookup table — just these numbers, arranged so that the calculation tends to produce useful output. Facts the model can recite from training, like a standard library API, are",
      "hash": "39eb2de56fb768500d533d73f7a5ad7e8cc65b1c43194d12f8fb0033e065bc42"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb765df2eecd0534d3283c156916b7a9c8e5301c7a808a08f311a583314d712a",
      "text": "parametric knowledge",
      "hash": "af45e8f3199438ecb8e32a5842d362c9e1486e34f1b2d9374b547824e0ceb837"
    },
    {
      "id": "aeb4b146073a1a479d4b11f9ae2cdec386acd2c5ad5cf074dee6fa0a6d3d7470",
      "text": ": stored in the parameters, not retrieved from anywhere.",
      "hash": "54620f26ee95ffc79c3333845e6e548f920c9888481cbad36d771577be90bc5e"
    },
    {
      "id": "3c0bb456ca5cbf2c8f6591b3c0e01d671680309bab68bca565047cffbfd7ffde",
      "text": "The detail worth internalising is that parameters are frozen after training. Nothing you do in a",
      "hash": "bd7dbe46c4db9c048098f455795347c9234607654bd93226ea6b43aa4db493c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "91a342ed6e3c9571dfe2228a335e105ef9c8081b725dbf25325db9b73c09caf9",
      "text": "changes them — no correction you make, no codebase you show it, no mistake it learns from. Every session runs on the same numbers. This is why the model is",
      "hash": "340c239ffc109ea7e3c4a5ab751acc80bfd51c8bd2b01ed079d5b0cd34fde980"
    },
    {
      "id": "7fad1a0ff0400f005325602d341f1c8816e81a419cdaed1ea027d5454a32793b",
      "text": ", why its built-in knowledge stops at the",
      "hash": "38190d22a5fd26f43097c95adfa0120d671aa074c15b5d6efbc82600de19cf44"
    },
    {
      "id": "b205c47de8b004488a49e5cc8fb4e9d17e3a75f88e6173708ef5226118040626",
      "text": "knowledge cutoff",
      "hash": "46f1820f6339cd5450653d0018ffb90af1d929a074ed2e211dfa39e52b7cc408"
    },
    {
      "id": "94b6a384b54a67793b7edf2052c5174711b110f74ab0513692751c9adf68840a",
      "text": ", and why anything project-specific has to arrive via",
      "hash": "f54a90db27631fde6fea2f99af0d57e6b9e453654e83457b2139041282475bc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9ec358e8f823f6c488a908043fd36d2507da163821dc4a63df883245e7b8b72",
      "text": "instead. The only way parameters change is more training — which produces, in effect, a different model.",
      "hash": "332f21a6f2efad51b78a2b9d07263ca5591f12c0a3c762812f44789cef4f74d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "5085d2e3ea46d91035dfad4fd652c530427412d600528fa424d314b769ef1735",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "d3f57234fb57c0e358e584afdc10417496e0368403615e34e64cded139eb2f83",
      "text": "\"Can we fine-tune it on our codebase?\"",
      "hash": "e229944813580fceee14f25c5dc379cf7ae07e881e0baf38d3bb1fe5456f2064"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c61895e46076409e3dca2bcb8f8beea557b0a19c78605a78e722d1c2f1bd8fd",
      "text": "\"That'd update the parameters — different model afterwards. For one project it's almost always cheaper to load the codebase as context than to retrain.\"",
      "hash": "6dd4c06b3acb5c15b509c0aef993e352b447e668df957ffc2eec4b670523b915"
    },
    {
      "id": "72aed78e08018e2daa1c209e5eefc2d6dc3ec6dbf67b76b144f2141d52f1e7b0",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "73e42cbf90e3007308e18611230f6938dcf8b4abe151c65ec575c99de0ce5673",
      "text": "Model",
      "hash": "5e2c614c23f02239bc03c6c04fcb681950f9e72bf8fdff6be79c79841cbb10c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c96f4b3b230f85072e5444c524d359b79af7df0c3dc5b8f5e2f702150e6a256",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "5858135dd65e1fe2f6231a9574fd84a779599d489cbbd012213b2cc5df2688a8",
      "text": "Training",
      "hash": "36a798e3f39239ccdec697ee348d2ce0a7b8d2d9087940496e2ca5d0853399f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8ad076d0a8eeacaa94d9636287ee3dc6594e919795e82caf9fabb73cabb72ca",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
